---
---

<section
  id="contact-hero"
  class="relative flex flex-col items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-white pt-24"
  style="min-height: 100svh;"
>
  <!-- Animated grid -->
  <div class="hero-grid absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <!-- Radial green glow -->
  <div
    class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none"
    style="background: radial-gradient(ellipse 100% 65% at 50% 30%, rgba(31,122,90,0.07) 0%, rgba(31,122,90,0.03) 45%, transparent 70%);"
    aria-hidden="true"
  ></div>

  <!-- ── Content ── -->
  <div class="relative z-10 w-full max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-8 md:px-16 text-center flex flex-col items-center py-20 md:py-28">

    <!-- Label with flanking lines -->
    <div class="reveal flex items-center justify-center gap-4 mb-10">
      <div style="width: 32px; height: 1px; background: rgba(31,122,90,0.45);"></div>
      <span class="section-label" style="color: #1F7A5A; letter-spacing: 0.2em;">LET'S BUILD THE FUTURE</span>
      <div style="width: 32px; height: 1px; background: rgba(31,122,90,0.45);"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- Heading -->
    <h1
      class="reveal reveal-delay-1 font-bold text-[#111827] leading-[1.03] tracking-[-0.04em] mb-8"
      style="font-size: clamp(52px, 7.5vw, 96px);"
    >
      What are you<br>
      <em class="not-italic" style="color: #1F7A5A;">building?</em>
    </h1>

    <!-- Description -->
    <p
      class="reveal reveal-delay-2 leading-[1.85]"
      style="font-size: clamp(16px, 1.8vw, 18px); color: #667085; max-width: 560px;"
    >
      We're interested in understanding ambitious ideas in Physical&nbsp;AI,
      robotics, autonomous systems, and intelligent machines.
    </p>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
  /* Animated grid */
  .hero-grid {
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(rgba(31, 122, 90, 0.04) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(31, 122, 90, 0.04) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 80px 80px;
    animation: gridDrift 60s linear infinite;
  }

  @keyframes gridDrift {
    from { background-position: 0 0; }
    to   { background-position: 80px 80px; }
  }
</style>
